256
00:20:59,944 --> 00:21:16,944
Very well, Mr. Curly Brows, I'll give you an update on Straw Boy.

257
00:21:16,944 --> 00:21:20,944
So what made you change your tune all of a sudden?

258
00:21:20,944 --> 00:21:21,944
Oh, please.

259
00:21:21,944 --> 00:21:25,944
There's no need to hide what the whole world knows anyway.

260
