267
00:21:36,944 --> 00:21:37,944
Please come with me.

268
00:21:38,944 --> 00:21:39,944
Goodness.

269
00:21:39,944 --> 00:21:44,944
Everyone seems to have learned a great deal about you since the war, haven't they, Dragon?

270
00:21:44,944 --> 00:21:47,944
That must have been very upsetting for your men.

271
