Regardless, I was surprised to hear you were there with him.

276
00:22:03,944 --> 00:22:06,944
Destiny sure works in interesting ways, huh?

277
00:22:06,944 --> 00:22:10,944
As for myself, it's been one twist after another.

278
00:22:10,944 --> 00:22:13,944
What with the prison break and meeting your little bundle of joy.

279
00:22:13,944 --> 00:22:16,944
Needless to say, I have several questions to ask you.

280
00:22:16,944 --> 00:22:18,944
I'm sure you do.

281
00:22:18,944 --> 00:22:23,944
The time has come for us to call our commanders from every corner of the world as quickly as possible.

282
00:22:23,944 --> 00:22:28,944
Now that Whitebeard is dead, the government, regime, and the world's situation are going to change.

283
00:22:28,944 --> 00:22:34,944
Not only that, but it occurs to me I haven't gotten to tell you what happened to Kuma.

284
00:22:34,944 --> 00:22:37,944
Yes, that certainly was a nasty surprise.

285
00:22:37,944 --> 00:22:41,944
Working for the government is bad enough, but now robot clones?

286
00:22:41,944 --> 00:22:44,944
I still can't believe he tried to do me in.

287
00:22:44,944 --> 00:22:47,944
I suppose the Kuma we once knew is no more.

288
00:22:49,944 --> 00:22:52,944
