295
00:23:16,944 --> 00:23:22,944
Luffy, Rayleigh, and Jinbei return to where Ace lost his life to carry out a mysterious plan.

296
00:23:22,944 --> 00:23:23,944
The world is shocked.

297
00:23:23,944 --> 00:23:25,944
But will Luffy's crew understand his actions?

298
